    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will consist of three phases: Pre-Conference, Conference and Post-Conference.  It will consist of substantive contributions to the following themes:

i)	How digital technologies can enhance democratic institutions, processes and practice, including through support to new forms of deliberative and participatory democratic mechanisms and their integration into established democratic processes. 
ii)	How a multi-stakeholder approach could strengthen democratic norms in the digital era by identifying strategies to close the digital divide (including inclusion and access), build digital capacities, ensure human rights and security online and promote responsible digital technologies.</narrative>
